          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "The story begins in two villages facing each other across a river in Thailand’s central region, once as close as family but now bitter rivals who haven’t wanted to look each other in the eye for over a decade. Pride chokes them—whoever gives in first is the loser. Then matters of the heart, wounded masculinity, and a fierce competition enter the picture, fanning the flames even higher. Just as the conflict between the two villages reaches its boiling point, a hidden threat begins to creep in, slowly and quietly, catching everyone off guard.",
